      "markdownRemark": {
        "html": "<div class=\"w-100 w-md-50 mx-auto my-3\">\n<center>\n<p>...</p>\n<h3>Artikel ini masih gue ketik...</h3>\n<h6> masih belum bahas desain & hasil belajarnya</h6>\n<p>...</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mx-auto w-100 w-md-50\">\nkok sekarang jadi frontend? gua jelasin timeline belajarnya gua dulu. Walaupun beberapa ada yg ga gua dalemin banget ya.\n</p>\n<div class=\"row w-100 w-md-50 mx-auto my-3\">\n<div class=\"p-0 py-lg-3 pr-lg-3 col-12 col-md-2 align-self-center text-left\">\n<h1>2014</h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-0 py-lg-3 pr-lg-3 col-12 col-md-10 align-self-center text-left\">\n<h3>Adobe Illustrator & Blogspot</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mx-auto w-100 w-md-50\">\nDi tahun ini gua pake software AI buat bikin karya ilustrasi kayak logo, vector, karakter, poster, dll. Dibawah ini merupakan karya-karya yang udah pernah gua buat. Selain itu gue juga mainan html + css buat ngerubah tampilan blogspot gue.\n</p>\n<div class=\"position-relative d-flex w-100 w-md-50 mx-auto\" style=\"grid-gap: 24px\">\n<div class=\"first-image\" style=\"width: 33%;\">\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 700px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/bd44d7cd622549d3c168837c35e2eb94/40619/game.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 125.06666666666668%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/bd44d7cd622549d3c168837c35e2eb94/e922d/game.webp 375w,\n/static/bd44d7cd622549d3c168837c35e2eb94/84c6d/game.webp 700w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            